## AI-Assisted

## Print the last lines of the Tor service log for tor-control-panel's Logs
## tab. A fixed-command wrapper, so a single privleap action / polkit policy can
## authorize exactly this (instead of authorizing journalctl with arbitrary
## arguments).

set -o errexit
set -o nounset
set -o pipefail
set -o errtrace
shopt -s inherit_errexit
shopt -s shift_verbose

/usr/bin/journalctl --no-pager --lines=200 --unit=tor@default.service
